-- HIDDEN OR UNASSIGNED CHARACTER ----------------------------- main.kl  SEC0112

I found U+E000, a tag character, private-use character, noncharacter or unassigned code point. It has no visible meaning in source code.

2│     let name = "Sara"
                     ^

Try: `\u{E000}`

Help: Delete it. If a string really needs it, write it as `\u{...}`.

Learn more: kalam explain SEC0112
